    "stimulus": "<p class=\"passage\">Palmetto Point Secondary is planning an \"IT Careers and Heritage Week\". Form 6 students must prepare a display that explains what Information Technology covers, how it relates to other computing fields, and how computers and the Internet developed to the point where a student in Basseterre can video-call a cousin in Guyana. A visiting software developer from <b>Seaview Systems</b> in Sandy Point will judge the display.</p>",
