    "stimulus": "<p class=\"passage\">Keisha, a first-year student at Flamboyant Heights College, is researching how communities in the British Virgin Islands rebuilt after Hurricane Irma in 2017. She has found a government recovery report, a refereed journal article on Caribbean disaster recovery, a blog by a Road Town resident, a Wikipedia article, and many posts in a local Facebook group. She also plans to interview her grandmother, who lived in East End, Tortola, during the storm.</p>",
