    "frame": "<p><b>(a)</b> A primary source ... e.g. ... whereas a secondary source ... e.g. ...<br><b>(b)(i)</b> A wiki is useful because ... However ... <b>(ii)</b> Social media ... However ...<br><b>(c)</b> Reliability: ... Currency: ... Depth: ...<br><b>(d)</b> Bias: ... Refereed or un-refereed: ... / Accuracy ...</p>",
