    "model": "<p><b>(a)</b> (i) The daily rental rate is <b>essential</b>: the system cannot calculate the charge without it. (ii) Last year's tourist numbers are <b>extraneous</b>: they are not needed to design the rental system. (iii) The friend's assurance about undamaged scooters is <b>cosmetic</b>: it looks like useful information but masks the missing damage records, so it cannot guide the design. (iv) Customers' preferred scooter colour is <b>desirable</b>: it could improve service but the system works without it.</p><p><b>(b)</b> <b>Error 1 – entity connected directly to a data store:</b> the flow from Customer goes straight into D2 Rentals. Data cannot move between an entity and a store without a process; correct it by sending the rental request to process 1 \"Process rental request\", which then writes the rental details to D2 Rentals. <b>Error 2 – black hole:</b> process 3 \"Monthly Report\" has input but no output, so data disappears. Add an output flow (e.g. <i>monthly rental report</i> to a Manager entity) and relabel the process with a verb phrase, \"Produce monthly report\". (Error 3 – <b>miracle</b>: process 4 \"Invoices\" produces an invoice with no input; add an input flow of <i>rental details</i> from D2 Rentals and relabel it \"Calculate invoice\".)</p><p><b>(c)</b> [Diagram described, Gane and Sarson] External entities (squares): <b>Customer</b>, <b>Mechanic</b>. Data stores (open-ended rectangles): <b>D1 Scooters</b>, <b>D2 Rentals</b>. Processes (rounded rectangles):</p><ul><li><b>1 Process rental request:</b> Customer → <i>rental request</i> → 1. D1 Scooters → <i>available scooter details</i> → 1. 1 → <i>rental details</i> → D2 Rentals. 1 → <i>scooter status (rented)</i> → D1 Scooters. 1 → <i>rental agreement</i> → Customer.</li><li><b>2 Process scooter return:</b> Customer → <i>returned scooter details</i> → 2. D2 Rentals → <i>rental record</i> → 2. 2 → <i>invoice</i> → Customer. 2 → <i>scooter status (available)</i> → D1 Scooters.</li><li><b>3 Update service record:</b> Mechanic → <i>service report</i> → 3. 3 → <i>updated service details</i> → D1 Scooters.</li></ul>",
