    "genre": "Paper 032 structured responses: problem definition and data gathering (20 marks)",
    "prompt": "<p>With reference to a problem which you have researched, answer the following questions.</p><p><b>(a)</b> Write a description of the problem you have researched. <i>[2 marks]</i></p><p><b>(b)</b> Discuss TWO causes of the problem identified in (a) above. <i>[6 marks]</i></p><p><b>(c)</b> For EACH data gathering tool below, explain ONE situation where it could be appropriately used for gathering data.</p><p><b>(i)</b> Interviews</p><p><b>(ii)</b> Questionnaires</p><p><b>(iii)</b> Observation</p><p><i>[6 marks]</i></p><p><b>(d)</b> Imagine that some of the users that you need to gather data from are located in various countries. For EACH of the three tools mentioned in (c) above, discuss ONE way in which it can be implemented using the Internet. <i>[6 marks]</i></p><p><b>[20 marks]</b></p>",
    "min": 350,
    "max": 950,
    "frame": "<p><b>(a)</b> The ... currently ... As a result ...<br><b>(b)</b> The first cause is ... This happens because ... The effect is ... The second cause is ...<br><b>(c)(i)</b> Interviews would be appropriate when ...<br><b>(ii)</b> Questionnaires would be appropriate when ...<br><b>(iii)</b> Observation would be appropriate when ...<br><b>(d)</b> The interview could be held over ... The questionnaire could be ... Observation could be done by ...</p>",
