     "model": "<p><b>(a)</b> The most feasible solution is Solution 1, the cloud-based dive booking system, because every booking goes into one live calendar, so double-booking stops.</p>\n<p><b>(b)</b> Another reason is that it is the cheapest solution: a monthly fee with no development cost, and deposits are linked to each booking, which solves the second cause.</p>\n<p><b>(c)</b> I would choose Solution 2, the custom booking module, instead because overseas customers could still book and pay online.</p>\n<p><b>(d)</b> One disadvantage is that it takes much longer to develop. To compensate, the shop could use a shared Google Calendar for all staff until the module is ready.</p>\n<p><b>(e)</b> I would use word processing software, such as Microsoft Word.</p>",
