     "model": "<p><b>(a)</b> Solution 1 is a cloud-based commercial car rental management system. It would give both offices one live fleet calendar and schedule servicing automatically. Solution 2 is GPS trackers with a fleet monitoring dashboard. It would track each car's location and mileage.</p>\n<p><b>(b)</b> Solution 1 is technically feasible because both offices already have computers and Internet access. It is economically feasible because it is a monthly subscription with no development cost. It is operationally feasible because staff can be trained quickly and use a tablet at check-out.</p>\n<p><b>(c)</b> One disadvantage of Solution 2 is that it does not stop double-renting, because bookings are still on the whiteboard.</p>\n<p><b>(d)</b> It is good to identify several solutions before choosing because the manager can compare them to find the best one, and has a back-up if the first choice fails.</p>",
