    "genre": "Paper 032 structured responses: possible solutions and feasibility (20 marks)",
    "prompt": "<p>Following the investigation, three possible solutions have been identified:</p><ul><li>Develop a custom School Management Information System.</li><li>Purchase a commercial School Management Information System.</li><li>Subscribe to a cloud-based School Management Information System.</li></ul><p><b>(a)</b> Discuss the THREE proposed solutions. <i>[9 marks]</i></p><p><b>(b)</b> Evaluate the feasibility of EACH solution using technical, economic and operational feasibility. <i>[9 marks]</i></p><p><b>(c)</b> Explain why organizations should evaluate several possible solutions before selecting one for implementation. <i>[2 marks]</i></p><p><b>[20 marks]</b></p>",
    "min": 400,
